//RS         // c109 Phase 6: a method call. The gate (`method_call_in_subset`) admitted
//RS         // exactly the synthetic `.clone()` or a user instance method on a covered
//RS         // type; lower accordingly. Every dispatch fact is resolved here (totality).
//RS         Expr::MethodCall { .. } => lower_method_chain(e, cx, env),
